      "value": "@{59a50e29df83a3566e6fb959|full_name}: I would like to bring this back up for the Following QoL updates, the JP playerbase and others have not yet recieved localization after years of requests. It would be a good time to start\n****Order of Priority***\n-UI localization \n-SDK localization\n-UDON localization options for world creators\netc",
